    "inputHash": "sha256:ced6f6ab1e00812c29c52988b0c3ff5a8e7aba0cfedbf5d71b7ab1f90eef1455",
    "notes": "The Forest of Remembrance is a planted memorial in El Retiro. Its north causeway, curved granite channel, three timber bridges, fluted column and rising spiral follow the mapped parcel and photographs. The detailed source represents the original 170 cypresses and 22 olive trees. The summit rises approximately 5.75 m above the entrance path in the model. Terraces, current tree heights, individual species assignment and unmapped planting positions are photo-led. The plaque is represented by its dark face. Inscription text and park furniture outside the memorial parcel remain outside the modeled scope."
  },
